  "prefLabel": "Rev 2602.05 Generation by a Residential Customer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2602.05 Generation by a Residential Customer. The generation of electricity by a person who is a residential customer under the tariff of the distribution company serving the geographic area where that person is located shall not make:\n\n(a) The residential customer a producer; or\n\n(b) The consumption of such generation subject to the tax under RSA 83-E.\n\nSource. #7479, eff 4-24-01; ss by #9443, eff 4-1-09; ss by #12138, eff 3-22-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2600.html"
}
